        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, our Operating Portfolio consisted of 39 operating assets comprising 15 multifamily assets totaling 6,519 units (6,333 units at our share), 22 commercial assets totaling 7.3 million square feet (6.9 million square feet at our share) and two wholly owned land assets for which we are the ground lessor.",
