        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In response to that trend, we are repositioning 2011 Crystal Drive, which will bring to National Landing a large-scale externally managed meeting and conference facility, two elevated food and beverage offerings, and an activated public lobby.",
