        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Amazon currently occupies two office buildings that we developed for them on Metropolitan Park in National Landing, totaling 2.1 million square feet, inclusive of approximately 50,000 square feet of street-level retail with shops and restaurants.",
