        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we estimate that our development pipeline can support 4.9 million square feet (3.6 million square feet at our share) of estimated potential development density: over 75.0% of this potential development density comprises multifamily projects predominately located in the National Landing submarket;",
